00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,800
Well, so, in risk analysis, like in the real,

45
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,640
when you're looking at how people assess risks,

46
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:44,900
then I don't know if they actually,

