if they actually cite a lay, but the general point,

48
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:49,960
the people seem to put a lot of value in getting rid

49
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,120
of really tiny risks.

50
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:53,820
And also just the way that the rhetoric

51
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,880
of eliminating a risk appeals to people so much.

52
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,420
The way that you sell a warranty.

53
